WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Defy the gods

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
And they will answer

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
The Dark Ships

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Ten years the Dark Ships waited, drawn upon a foreign shore.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Ten years the Fathers buried sons, and sons grew old in war.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Then came the Horse of Timber, silent beneath the moon.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
The Trojans opened their gates, and welcomed in their doom.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Give thanks to Zeus Almighty.
